<title>FRANCE: Air France to add Bogota freighter stop.</title>
<headline>Air France to add Bogota freighter stop.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France Cargo said it planned to increase weekly Boeing 747 freighter flights to Bogota from two to three from end-October.</p>
<p>&quot;We recently announced the upgrading of our Paris-Mexico City freighter weekly and the new frequency will make a stopover at Bogota on the return leg,&quot; told Reuters.</p>
<p>Air France' currently operates two return freighter flights between Paris-Bogota with a stopover at London-Stansted on the inbound leg. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
